What:		/sys/power/system_sleep/stats
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	KAI-Miru kernel maintainers
Description:
		Read-only Qualcomm RPMh system-sleep statistics. Each firmware
		record includes its mode, entry count, last-mode duration, elapsed
		time since the previous exit and accumulated sleep duration.

What:		/sys/power/system_sleep/oplus_rpmh_stats
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	KAI-Miru kernel maintainers
Description:
		Read-only compact OPLUS view of the AOSS deep-sleep and CX-collapse
		counters, exported as vlow:COUNT:DURATION_MS and
		vmin:COUNT:DURATION_MS.

What:		/sys/power/rpmh_stats/master_stats
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	KAI-Miru kernel maintainers
Description:
		Read-only APSS and subsystem RPMh residency records. Available
		masters can include MPSS, ADSP, CDSP, SLPI, GPU and DISPLAY.

What:		/sys/power/rpmh_stats/oplus_rpmh_master_stats
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	KAI-Miru kernel maintainers
Description:
		Read-only compact OPLUS master-residency view. Each line uses the
		NAME:COUNT:DURATION_MS format consumed by the ColorOS power stack.
